[["Map",1,2,97,98,105,106],"docs",["Map",3,4,29,30,49,50,68,69],"404",{"id":3,"data":5,"filePath":16,"digest":17,"rendered":18},{"title":6,"editUrl":7,"head":8,"template":9,"hero":10,"sidebar":13,"pagefind":7,"draft":7},"Page not found",false,[],"splash",{"tagline":11,"actions":12},"The page you requested does not exist. Check the URL or return to the overview.",[],{"hidden":14,"attrs":15},true,{},"src/content/docs/404.md","752ec671b375d337",{"html":19,"metadata":20},"",{"headings":21,"localImagePaths":22,"remoteImagePaths":23,"frontmatter":24,"imagePaths":28},[],[],[],{"title":6,"template":9,"editUrl":7,"pagefind":7,"sidebar":25,"hero":26},{"hidden":14},{"tagline":11,"actions":27},[],[],"development",{"id":29,"data":31,"body":38,"filePath":39,"digest":40,"rendered":41},{"title":32,"description":33,"editUrl":14,"head":34,"template":35,"sidebar":36,"pagefind":14,"draft":7},"Development","Build and validate adr-repo-governance locally.",[],"doc",{"hidden":7,"attrs":37},{},"The repository requires Go for local development. Run the focused checks before publishing changes:\n\n```bash\ngo test ./...\ngo vet ./...\nadr check adr --strict\nadr index --check\n```\n\nRun `adr bs-detector --base main` before source changes when reviewing a branch. Do not edit the generated index by hand.","src/content/docs/development.md","060393f5c9463aee",{"html":42,"metadata":43},"\u003Cp>The repository requires Go for local development. Run the focused checks before publishing changes:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"expressive-code\">\u003Clink rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/adr-repo-governance/_astro/ec.w36nc.css\">\u003Cscript type=\"module\" src=\"/adr-repo-governance/_astro/ec.0vx5m.js\">\u003C/script>\u003Cfigure class=\"frame is-terminal not-content\">\u003Cfigcaption class=\"header\">\u003Cspan class=\"title\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\">Terminal window\u003C/span>\u003C/figcaption>\u003Cpre data-language=\"bash\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"code\